# Subrange violation: implementation-defined.
#
# ed.3 6.4.4.4.3 / ed.2 2.3.3.1 give the limits of a subrange and say
# nothing about a value outside them (ed.3 6.4.4.4.3 only notes that the
# behaviour "is implementation-dependent"). In range (cycle 0 and 3) the
# value is simply stored. Out of range, this trace records IronPLC's
# behaviour: the value is stored unchecked (20, -3).
period_ms: 100
program: main
inputs: v
outputs: s
status: implementation-defined
reference: IEC 61131-3 ed.3 6.4.4.4.3 (subrange); ed.2 2.3.3.1
---
0 v=7 => s=7
1 v=20 => s=20
2 v=-3 => s=-3
3 v=10 => s=10
